  ⚠ svelte(no-raw-special-elements): Special head element is deprecated in v5, use svelte:head instead.
   ╭─[no_raw_special_elements.tsx:1:1]
 1 │ <head></head>
   · ──────
   ╰────
  help: Rename `<head>` to `<svelte:head>`; Svelte 5 renders the raw element literally instead of treating it specially.

